= Instructions

Add @Goslings Black Seal rum{2 oz} and freshly squeezed @Lime juice{1/2 oz} to a #Tall glass{} filled with @Ice{}.

Top with the @Ginger beer{~5 oz}.

Garnish with a @Lime wheel{}. 